Fires a shot that explodes into a radius [1, 1, 2, 2, 2 (TL1-5)] ball of razor sharp fragments on impact, dealing [122%, 131%, 138%, 144%, 150% (TL1-5)] weapon damage and leaving targets crippled for [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns, reducing their attack, spell and mind speed by [10%, 22%, 28%, 33%, 36% (TL1-5)].

Each target struck has a 20% chance to be marked.

The status chance increases with your Accuracy.
